            "action": "REFRESHED_TOMBSTONE_ONTOLOGY_ID",
            "changes": "ontology_id CHEBI:48843 -> CHEBI:131361 (#360). The merge set identifier and status but left ontology_mapping untouched, so this tombstone kept advertising a term it no longer asserts — anything indexing by ontology_id routed through it. Now agrees with the merge target 'Na2SeO3 x 5 H2O'. Provenance is unaffected: what the record used to assert is in this history.",
            "llm_assisted": false
          },
          {
